@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> UserType

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> Registration : [Citizen]
UserType --> Login : [Registered Citizen]
Login --> LoggedOut : [Incorrect details]
Registration --> RegisteredCitizen
LoggedOut --> [*]

state RegisteredCitizen
RegisteredCitizen : entry / Get the Registration Details
RegisteredCitizen : validate / Check if details are accepted
RegisteredCitizen : save / Save user's information after successful registration
RegisteredCitizen : end / End the process if registration details are not accepted

state Login
Login : entry / Enter username and password
Login : check / Continue if login is successful
Login : attempt : [Multiple attempts if details are incorrect]

state Citizen
Citizen : uploadDocuments : [Upload documents, view profile, or apply for a certificate]
Citizen : continueUploads : [Continue uploading documents if needed after initial uploads]
Citizen : applyCertificates : [Apply for multiple certificates and reapply after sending a request to the issuer]
Citizen : requestVerification : [Registrars can request certificates for verification]
Citizen : endSession : [End the session once the user is done with their actions]
LoggedOut --> Citizen : [Successful login]
@enduml
